# Runtime version uses the "fingerprint" policy, and EAS rejects a build whose
# fingerprint differs from the one eas-cli computed on this machine.
# A local `expo run:android` lets React Native's Gradle plugin strip the
# deprecated package="…" attribute from library manifests in node_modules
# (in place); EAS hashes a clean install. Keep those manifests out of the hash
# (a package upgrade still changes the fingerprint via its other files).
**/node_modules/**/android/src/main/AndroidManifest.xml
